B.a55=new A.iM("Sample data and your data","The sample shop is fictional. Please do not treat the trial workspace as your only record of your stock; keep your own copy of anything important.")
B.a59=new A.iM("Upgrading","To keep using StockSense, choose a plan and our team will contact you to set up your account. Plan prices are shown in Kenya shillings (KES) and are confirmed when you upgrade.")
