B.a1J=new A.jQ("How do I add a new inventory item?","Open the Items tab and tap Add Item (or use Add Item on the dashboard). Fill in the name, description, category, quantity, price and supplier. You can also add a photo and an expiry date for perishable items.")
B.a1C=new A.jQ("How do stock predictions work?","StockSense studies your recent stock-out movements to estimate how many days of stock you have left for each item. The more movements you record, the more reliable the estimate. Confidence shows High, Medium or Low depending on how much recent data is available.")
B.a1D=new A.jQ("How will I know when stock is low or expiring?","Low-stock and out-of-stock items are flagged on your dashboard and in the Items list, and expiring or expired items appear in Expiry Alerts. During the free trial, alerts are shown inside the app. Email alerts are not part of the trial.")
B.a1E=new A.jQ("What are reorder levels?","A reorder level is the minimum quantity you want to keep of an item. When stock falls to that level or below, the item is flagged as Low Stock. You can set a custom level when you add or edit an item.")
