B.a1G=new A.jQ("Can I export my data or get reports?","Reports and exports are part of full plans. Tap Upgrade to compare plans, or Book a Consultation and we will show you what is included.")
B.a1F=new A.jQ("How do I scan barcodes?","Scanning needs a phone or tablet camera and is not available in the browser yet. You can add any item with the Add Item form.")
B.a1I=new A.jQ("What happens when items expire?","Perishable items with an expiry date appear in Expiry Alerts: expired items in red and items expiring soon in orange, so you can sell or remove them in time.")
